This privacy policy pertains to the PerthFin app.

PerthFin does not collect or access any personal information. No identifying information or user data of any kind is made available to third parties.

PerthFin is an unofficial fork of Findroid. The app only connects to the Jellyfin servers you configure; server credentials and playback data stay between your device and your server.

This Privacy Policy is effective as of November 16th, 2026. We reserve the right to update or change this policy at any time; changes take effect when posted in this repository.

For questions, open an issue at https://github.com/MeowPerth/findroid/issues.
